{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check out Bioframe Outpost, the newest game from the co-creators of Eufloria! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the celebrated strategy gameplay of indie hit Eufloria HD.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer asteroids in space and use their resources to grow <strong>floral creatures</strong> that do the player's bidding. <strong>Expand your empire</strong> and fight for resources against several teams of AI opponents that all vie for the same resources and can offer fierce opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eufloria HD enhances the original Eufloria release with new mechanics, streamlined UI, ultrabalanced gameplay &amp; more, without losing any of its unique floral space-empires charms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A 25 level \u201cStory Mode\u201d with many hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cRelaxed Mode\u201d, for a more ambient experience which anyone can enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cSkirmish Levels\u201d that can be played over and over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cDark Matter Mode\u201d for a stylish, more challenging way to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original ambient soundtrack by \u201cMilieu\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many procedurally generated levels which are different every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Includes official Linux/OSX version for the first time!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starboretum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/221180/289118cd86eb8041ced044e12b85ab315f91c70c.jpg"},{"name":"Illuminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/221180/64dfb58663a3657503d9479e30b12b69b6502b39.jpg"},{"n