:null},"detailed_description":"<h1>WHAT'S THE DIFFERENCE?</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/221180/extras/c3e4f52240bce1545052298c98803777.avif?t=1769103261\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/221180/extras_big/c3e4f52240bce1545052298c98803777.avif?t=1769103261 width=1560 height=1970 /></span></p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/221180/extras/37309a2567fec92a421c168e431f9a84.avif?t=1769103261\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/221180/extras_big/37309a2567fec92a421c168e431f9a84.avif?t=1769103261 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Check out Bioframe Outpost, the newest game from the co-creators of Eufloria! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the celebrated strategy gameplay of indie hit Eufloria HD.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer asteroids in space and use their resources to grow <strong>floral creatures</strong> that do the player's bidding. <strong>Expand your empire</strong> and fight for resources against several teams of AI opponents that all vie for the same resources and can offer fierce opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eufloria HD enhances the original Eufloria release with new mechanics, streamlined UI, ultrabalanced gameplay &amp; more, without losing any of its unique floral space-empires charms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A 25 level \u201cStory Mode\u201d with many hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cRelaxed Mode\u201d, for a more ambient experience which anyone can enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cSkirmish Levels\u201d that can be played over and over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u201cDark Matter Mode\u201d for a stylish, more challenging way to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original ambient soundtrack by \u201cMilieu\u201d.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many procedurally generated levels which are different every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Includes official Linux/OSX version for the first time!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rudolf Kremers & Alex May","Tuna"],"dlc":[327040],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/221180/45aeffb8488870529e2759d6a3c7c1ae8b3473f5/header.jpg?t=1769103261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB 3D Graphics Card with OpenGL support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX Snow Leopard 10.6.8, or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB 3D Graphics Card with OpenGL support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Two Button Mouse Recommended</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/221180/26016/40763ee55aa085d4ffbb83babaf60aba8e432058/1751246549/dash_av1.mpd?t=1447364026","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/221180/26016/40763ee55aa085d4ffbb83babaf60aba8e432058/1751246549/dash_h26